    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 558.04,
      "end": 559.04,
      "en": "Now, let's take a look at our last one.",
      "zh": "现在，让我们来看看我们的最后一个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 559.05,
      "end": 560.37,
      "en": "And this is a really great phrase.",
      "zh": "这是一个非常棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 561.52,
      "end": 561.75,
      "en": "Break down.",
      "zh": "发生故障。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 562.52,
      "end": 562.77,
      "en": "Break down.",
      "zh": "发生故障。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 563.52,
      "end": 565.27,
      "en": "In our dialogue, we heard breaking down.",
      "zh": "在对话中，我们听到了 breaking down 这个说法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 565.8,
      "end": 566.8,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 566.8,
      "end": 567.8,
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 567.8,
      "end": 569.56,
      "en": "Everything in the office seems to be breaking down.",
      "zh": "办公室里的东西好像都在出故障。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 569.56,
      "end": 570.56,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 570.56,
      "end": 571.81,
      "en": "So, when something breaks down...",
      "zh": "所以，当有什么东西坏了..."
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 572.2,
      "end": 572.75,
      "en": "It stops working.",
      "zh": "它不运转了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 573.4,
      "end": 574.01,
      "en": "It stops working.",
      "zh": "它不运转了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 574.4,
      "end": 575.4,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 575.4,
      "end": 576.4,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 576.4,
      "end": 577.4,
      "en": "So, we can change it a little bit.",
      "zh": "所以，我们可以稍微改变一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 577.4,
      "end": 579.12,
      "en": "So, what if we say, break up?",
      "zh": "那么，如果我们说分手呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 579.15,
      "end": 580.11,
      "en": "Ooh, boyfriend and girlfriend.",
      "zh": "哦，男朋友和女朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 580.71,
      "end": 580.87,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 581.31,
      "end": 582.35,
      "en": "They end their relationship.",
      "zh": "他们结束了他们的关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 582.75,
      "end": 582.87,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 582.89,
      "end": 587.09,
      "en": "So, we can maybe think about it as their relationship stops working.",
      "zh": "所以，我们可以考虑一下，因为他们的关系停止了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 587.44,
      "end": 588.05,
      "en": "Oh, nice one.",
      "zh": "哦，不错的一张。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 588.44,
      "end": 589.44,
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 589.44,
      "end": 590.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 590.44,
      "end": 591.44,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 591.44,
      "end": 592.44,
      "en": "What about break in?",
      "zh": "闯入呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 592.44,
      "end": 594.36,
      "en": "Enter a place using force.",
      "zh": "使用武力进入一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 594.36,
      "end": 595.6,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 595.6,
      "end": 596.95,
      "en": "You enter a house that's not yours.",
      "zh": "你进入一个不属于你的房子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 597.2,
      "end": 598.2,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 598.2,
      "end": 601.48,
      "en": "So, if you break into a house, maybe you break the window and climb in.",
      "zh": "所以，如果你闯入一所房子，也许你会打破窗户并爬进去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 601.49,
      "end": 601.79,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 602.48,
      "end": 603.48,
      "en": "Mm-hmm.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 603.48,
      "end": 604.48,
      "en": "What about break out?",
      "zh": "爆发呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 604.48,
      "end": 605.48,
      "en": "The opposite.",
      "zh": "反之。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 605.48,
      "end": 606.48,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 606.48,
      "end": 608.52,
      "en": "So, break out of jail.",
      "zh": "所以是越狱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 608.52,
      "end": 608.92,
      "en": "Break out of prison.",
      "zh": "越狱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 609.52,
      "end": 610.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 610.52,
      "end": 611.52,
      "en": "So, this is a great phrase.",
      "zh": "所以，这是一个很好的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 611.52,
      "end": 618.8,
      "en": "You can change the last word from break down, break up, break in, and it means different things.",
      "zh": "你可以换掉 break down、break up、break in 里的最后一个词，意思就不同了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 618.8,
      "end": 619.8,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 619.8,
      "end": 620.8,
      "en": "So, use different prepositions for different meanings.",
      "zh": "因此，使用不同的介词来表示不同的含义。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 620.8,
      "end": 621.08,
      "en": "Perfect.",
      "zh": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 621.8,
      "end": 622.8,
      "en": "Mm-hmm.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 622.8,
      "end": 623.8,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 623.8,
      "end": 634.48,
      "en": "So, now let's listen to our dialogue for the last time, and then Erica and I will be back and talk a little bit more about malfunctioning office supplies.",
      "zh": "所以，现在让我们最后一次听听我们的对话，然后 Erica 和我会回来多谈一些关于故障办公用品的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 640.48,
      "end": 644.29,
      "en": "Hey, Carl, can you make a copy of this contract for me, please?",
      "zh": "嘿，卡尔，你能帮我复印这份合同吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 645.0,
      "end": 649.04,
      "en": "And when you have it ready, send it out ASAP to our sub-branch.",
      "zh": "当你准备好时，尽快将其发送到我们的分支机构。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 650.11,
      "end": 650.55,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 663.38,
      "end": 665.16,
      "en": "I think I broke this thing.",
      "zh": "我好像把这台复印机弄坏了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 665.62,
      "end": 666.88,
      "en": "Maxine, can you help me out here?",
      "zh": "马克辛，你能帮帮我吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 667.18,
      "end": 668.34,
      "en": "I'm not really a tech guy.",
      "zh": "我不太懂这些机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 669.54,
      "end": 670.26,
      "en": "Yeah, sure.",
      "zh": "好啊，当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 670.58,
      "end": 672.02,
      "en": "I think it's just out of toner.",
      "zh": "我看只是墨粉用完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 672.42,
      "end": 674.22,
      "en": "You can go use the other one upstairs.",
      "zh": "楼上还有一台，你可以用那台。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 674.78,
      "end": 678.44,
      "en": "On your way up, can you fax this while I try and fix this thing?",
      "zh": "上楼时能顺便帮我把这份传真发了吗？我来修这台机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 679.78,
      "end": 680.14,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 686.05,
      "end": 686.63,
      "en": "Damn it!",
      "zh": "该死！"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 687.21,
      "end": 688.97,
      "en": "Everything in this office seems to be breaking down.",
      "zh": "办公室里的设备好像都在坏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 689.9,
      "end": 691.46,
      "en": "I'll send the stupid fax later.",
      "zh": "这该死的传真我晚点再发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 697.4,
      "end": 697.9,
      "en": "Oh great!",
      "zh": "太好了!"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 698.32,
      "end": 699.98,
      "en": "Is someone playing a practical joke on me?",
      "zh": "有人在对我开恶作剧吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 700.08,
      "end": 700.52,
      "en": "This is ridiculous!",
      "zh": "太荒唐了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 702.14,
      "end": 703.62,
      "en": "The elevator has some sort of malfunction.",
      "zh": "电梯好像出故障了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 704.34,
      "end": 705.2,
      "en": "Just take the stairs dude.",
      "zh": "走楼梯吧，哥们儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 705.66,
      "end": 706.62,
      "en": "What floor are you going to?",
      "zh": "你要去哪一层？"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 707.43,
      "end": 709.11,
      "en": "I have to go up 15 floors!",
      "zh": "我必须上15层！"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 709.97,
      "end": 710.59,
      "en": "Never mind.",
      "zh": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 720.76,
      "end": 721.18,
      "en": "Made it.",
      "zh": "终于到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 722.1,
      "end": 729.1,
      "en": "There's the copier.",
      "zh": "复印机在那边。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 729.1,
      "end": 736.1,
      "en": "No!",
      "zh": "不！"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 736.1,
      "end": 746.98,
      "en": "Alright, so Erica, everything that you touch that's electronic seems to malfunction, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，所以埃里卡，你触摸的所有电子产品似乎都出现故障了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 746.98,
      "end": 748.1,
      "en": "This is absolutely true.",
      "zh": "这是绝对正确的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 749.1,
      "end": 755.34,
      "en": "I don't know what it is, but you know what, if I turn on a computer it will suddenly get a virus.",
      "zh": "我不知道它是什么，但你知道吗，如果我打开电脑，它会突然感染病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 756.66,
      "end": 758.76,
      "en": "And even if I'm very careful it still breaks.",
      "zh": "即使我非常小心，它还是会坏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 759.18,
      "end": 759.32,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 759.84,
      "end": 760.72,
      "en": "Yeah, it happens sometimes.",
      "zh": "是的，有时会发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 760.92,
      "end": 761.78,
      "en": "I can relate to that.",
      "zh": "我能理解。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 762.66,
      "end": 767.06,
      "en": "But you are much better at computers and technology than I am.",
      "zh": "但你在计算机和技术方面比我好得多。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 767.66,
      "end": 769.36,
      "en": "Well, I really, really like them.",
      "zh": "嗯，我真的、真的很喜欢这些东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 769.78,
      "end": 776.66,
      "en": "And well, I guess even I know a little bit about copy machines or copiers because my uncles are like copy technicians.",
      "zh": "好吧，我想我懂一点复印机，因为我叔叔算是复印机技术员。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 777.1,
      "end": 778.1,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 778.1,
      "end": 787.96,
      "en": "Yeah, so they fix copiers that broke down or they replace toner and they do all that stuff so that's why I know a little bit about it.",
      "zh": "是的，他们修理坏掉的复印机，更换碳粉，做这些事，所以我才懂一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 788.46,
      "end": 790.54,
      "en": "But actually the original term is a Xerox machine.",
      "zh": "但实际上，最初的术语是 Xerox 机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 790.94,
      "end": 791.78,
      "en": "Yes, why is that?",
      "zh": "是的，为什么会这样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 791.98,
      "end": 792.66,
      "en": "From the brand, right?",
      "zh": "来自品牌，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 792.94,
      "end": 793.44,
      "en": "Ah, right.",
      "zh": "啊，对了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 793.8,
      "end": 800.2,
      "en": "There's a brand called Xerox and Xerox invented and patented this technology of making copies.",
      "zh": "有个品牌叫 Xerox，正是 Xerox 发明并申请了这项复印技术的专利。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 800.82,
      "end": 805.26,
      "en": "Alright well the next time my photocopier explodes I'll call you.",
      "zh": "好吧，下次我的复印机爆炸时，我会打电话给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 805.26,
      "end": 807.38,
      "en": "Call my uncles, right?",
      "zh": "打电话给我的叔叔，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 807.38,
      "end": 816.06,
      "en": "Alright and well let us know how things in your office break down or if you have any stories of like Erica that breaks everything she touches.",
      "zh": "好吧，也请告诉我们你办公室里有什么东西出故障，或者你有没有像 Erica 那样碰什么坏什么的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 816.06,
      "end": 816.24,
      "en": "It's true.",
      "zh": "是真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 817.06,
      "end": 824.54,
      "en": "Alright, so come to our website, come to our comment section and leave your opinions and we'll be there to also answer any doubts or questions you might have.",
      "zh": "好的，请访问我们的网站，访问我们的评论部分并留下您的意见，我们也会在那里回答您可能有的任何疑问或问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 824.9,
      "end": 825.02,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 825.9,
      "end": 830.12,
      "en": "You can find us at EnglishPod.com and Marco and I are always around.",
      "zh": "你可以在 EnglishPod.com 找到我们，我和 Marco 一直都在。"
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 830.66,
      "end": 831.86,
      "en": "Alright so we'll see you guys there.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们会在那里见到你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 330,
      "start": 832.14,
      "end": 834.02,
      "en": "Yep, we will.",
      "zh": "是的，我们会的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 331,
      "start": 834.02,
      "end": 836.42,
      "en": "Okay guys, thanks for listening and until next time.",
      "zh": "好的，感谢您的收听，直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 332,
      "start": 837.0,
      "end": 837.14,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 333,
      "start": 837.58,
      "end": 845.923,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
